Here is the semantic interpretation of the scene images grounded in the provided ontology vocabulary:

Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime scene with fallen tree" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .
:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Fallen tree blocking the road" .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Obstacle in vehicle's lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

